│ ```                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ According to <https://github.com/sphinx-doc/sphinx/blob/3.x/sphinx/domains/cpp.py#L4770> Sphinx seems to not have    │
│ features for UDLs. Could you please add those?                                                                       │
